	(text "Pinout per hw/module.md (H11): nothing but signals leaves the module; JTAG on J1 is unrouted on production carriers. VBAT_CELL: RTC backup from a primary battery. ETH_LED1/2 are the PHY LED outputs for the carrier jack."
